{
  "provider": "STUBA",
  "providerHotelId": "4972163",
  "name": "Hansar Bangkok Hotel",
  "starRating": 5,
  "descriptions": [
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RXLContentId",
      "text": "3909098"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "SurroundingArea",
      "text": "With a stay at Hansar Bangkok Hotel, you\u0027ll be centrally located in Bangkok, a 8-minute walk from Erawan Shrine and 13 minutes by foot from Lumphini Park.  This luxury hotel is 0.8 mi (1.3 km) from Siam Paragon Mall and 0.9 mi (1.4 km) from Siam Center."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RoomTypes",
      "text": "Make yourself at home in one of the 94 guestrooms featuring refrigerators and DVD players. Your pillowtop bed comes with down comforters and Egyptian cotton sheets. Flat-screen televisions with satellite programming provide entertainment, while complimentary wireless internet access keeps you connected. Private bathrooms with separate bathtubs and showers feature rainfall showerheads and complimentary toiletries."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PropertyInformation",
      "text": "Relax at the full-service spa, where you can enjoy massages, body treatments, and facials. If you\u0027re looking for recreational opportunities, you\u0027ll find an outdoor pool, a spa tub, and a sauna. This hotel also features complimentary wireless internet access, concierge services, and babysitting (surcharge).Featured amenities include a business center, limo/town car service, and dry cleaning/laundry services. Event facilities at this hotel consist of a conference center and 5 meeting rooms. A roundtrip airport shuttle is provided for a surcharge (available 24 hours), and free self parking is available onsite."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "AreaActivities",
      "text": "Distances are displayed to the nearest 0.1 mile and kilometer. \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003Cp\u003EErawan Shrine - 0.7 km / 0.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E CentralWorld Shopping Complex - 0.9 km / 0.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Lumphini Park - 1.1 km / 0.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Central Chidlom Department Store - 1.1 km / 0.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Chulalongkorn Hospital - 1.2 km / 0.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Siam Square - 1.4 km / 0.8 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Siam Paragon Mall - 1.4 km / 0.8 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Central Embassy - 1.4 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Embassy of Switzerland - 1.4 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Siam Center - 1.4 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Embassy of the United States - 1.5 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Pratunam Market - 1.5 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Platinum Fashion Mall - 1.5 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Silom Complex Shopping Mall - 1.6 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Chulalongkorn University - 1.7 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe nearest airports are:\u003Cbr /\u003EDon Mueang Intl. Airport (DMK) - 23.8 km / 14.8 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Suvarnabhumi Intl. Airport (BKK) - 31.5 km / 19.6 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe preferred airport for Hansar Bangkok Hotel is Suvarnabhumi Intl. Airport (BKK). \u003C/p\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PoliciesDisclaimers",
      "text": null
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "DiningFacilities",
      "text": "Grab a bite to eat at Eve, a fine-dining restaurant which features a bar/lounge, or stay in and take advantage of the room service (during limited hours). Wrap up your day with a drink at the poolside bar. Buffet breakfasts are available daily from 7:00 AM to 10:30 AM for a fee."
    }
  ],
